msgstr "You have reduced data movement. Now overlap unavoidable transfers with useful computation.\n\nOne transfer engine. One compute engine. Arrange requests, decide when to wait, and choose temporary storage.\n\nUpper path: explicit buffers and backpressure.\nLower path: hardware-managed Cache and prefetch.\n\nEvery workload, budget and target is public. Equivalent solutions are welcome."

